{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n<your_rewritten_code_3>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main3 {\n\n    private static final int MOD = 998244353;\n    private static long[] factorialArray;\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {\n        BufferedReader reader = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        String[] input = reader.readLine().split(\"\\\\s+\");\n        int N = Integer.parseInt(input[0]);\n        long pk = Long.parseLong(input[1]);\n        \n        if (pk > N - 1) {\n            System.out.println(0);\n            return;\n        }\n        \n        int k = (int) pk;\n        int c = N - k;\n        \n        factorialArray = new long[N + 1];\n        factorialArray[0] = 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i <= N; i++) {\n            factorialArray[i] = (i * factorialArray[i - 1]) % MOD;\n        }\n        \n        long total = 0;\n        int alternating = 1;\n        \n        for (int j = c; j >= 0; j--) {\n            long term = (binomial(c, j) * fastExponentiation(j, N)) % MOD;\n            total = (total + alternating * term) % MOD;\n            if (total < 0) total += MOD;\n            alternating *= -1;\n        }\n        \n        total = (total * binomial(N, c)) % MOD;\n        if (k != 0) total = (2 * total) % MOD;\n        \n        System.out.println((total + MOD) % MOD);\n    }\n    \n    private static long binomial(int n, int r) {\n        if (r < 0 || r > n) return 0;\n        long denominator = (factorialArray[r] * factorialArray[n - r]) % MOD;\n        return (factorialArray[n] * modularInverse(denominator)) % MOD;\n    }\n    \n    private static long fastExponentiation(long base, int exponent) {\n        long result = 1;\n        base %= MOD;\n        while (exponent > 0) {\n            if ((exponent & 1) == 1) {\n                result = (result * base) % MOD;\n            }\n            base = (base * base) % MOD;\n            exponent >>>= 1;\n        }\n        return result;\n    }\n    \n    private static long modularInverse(long value) {\n        return fastExponentiation(value, MOD - 2);\n    }\n}\n</your_rewritten_code_3>\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <sstream>\n#include <algorithm>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst int MOD = 998244353;\nvector<long long> factorialArray;\n\nlong long fastExponentiation(long long base, int exponent) {\n    long long result = 1;\n    base %= MOD;\n    while (exponent > 0) {\n        if ((exponent & 1) == 1) {\n            result = (result * base) % MOD;\n        }\n        base = (base * base) % MOD;\n        exponent >>= 1;\n    }\n    return result;\n}\n\nlong long modularInverse(long long value) {\n    return fastExponentiation(value, MOD - 2);\n}\n\nlong long binomial(int n, int r) {\n    if (r < 0 || r > n) return 0;\n    long long denominator = (factorialArray[r] * factorialArray[n - r]) % MOD;\n    return (factorialArray[n] * modularInverse(denominator)) % MOD;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    string line;\n    getline(cin, line);\n    stringstream ss(line);\n    vector<string> input;\n    string token;\n    while (ss >> token) {\n        input.push_back(token);\n    }\n    \n    int N = stoi(input[0]);\n    long long pk = stoll(input[1]);\n    \n    if (pk > N - 1) {\n        cout << 0 << endl;\n        return 0;\n    }\n    \n    int k = (int)pk;\n    int c = N - k;\n    \n    factorialArray.resize(N + 1);\n    factorialArray[0] = 1;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= N; i++) {\n        factorialArray[i] = (i * factorialArray[i - 1]) % MOD;\n    }\n    \n    long long total = 0;\n    int alternating = 1;\n    \n    for (int j = c; j >= 0; j--) {\n        long long term = (binomial(c, j) * fastExponentiation(j, N)) % MOD;\n        total = (total + alternating * term) % MOD;\n        if (total < 0) total += MOD;\n        alternating *= -1;\n    }\n    \n    total = (total * binomial(N, c)) % MOD;\n    if (k != 0) total = (2 * total) % MOD;\n    \n    cout << (total + MOD) % MOD << endl;\n    \n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00011991735664196312, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -9.536738616588991e-07, -0.0004661188868340105, -7.152555099310121e-07, -7.033323527139146e-06, -2.264974000354414e-06, -3.814689989667386e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.1621418595314026, -6.437280717364047e-06, -4.076874756719917e-05, -8.344646857949556e-07, -0.02168574370443821, -1.2040065485052764e-05, -0.0010334871476516128, -6.6756979322235566e-06, -0.002806655131280422, -0.28115424513816833, -0.28119492530822754, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.18082699179649353, -0.12693245708942413, -0.10031107813119888, -1.3828182090946939e-05, -2.3841830625315197e-06, -9.536738616588991e-07, -0.0008102948195300996, -0.25193923711776733, -4.291525328881107e-06, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.814689989667386e-06, -1.1444026313256472e-05, -2.622600959512056e-06